{"format":"frame-text","version":1,"id":"0f632ae4-7648-4852-a042-fbaf014a9bd3","title":"11. Exporter et partager","created":"2026-11-18T08:00:00.000Z","modified":"2026-11-18T08:00:00.000Z","settings":{"autoIndent":false,"titleInText":true,"columns":{"count":1,"rule":false},"languages":["fr"],"index":[],"comments":[],"theme":{"v":1,"id":"moderne","name":"Moderne","note":"Open Sans et Montserrat, bleu, tableaux à bandes.","modified":false,"text":{"font":"Open Sans","size":11,"line":1.55,"space":0.7,"align":""},"accent":"#2e5c8a","styles":{"title":{"font":"Montserrat","size":24,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},"headings":[{"font":"Montserrat","size":18,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":14,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":12,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":true,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":true,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""}],"bullets":[{"symbol":"–","color":""},{"symbol":"•","color":""},{"symbol":"◦","color":""},{"symbol":"▪","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""}],"numbers":["1","1","1","1","1"]},"table":{"style":"grille","color":"theme","header":true,"first":false,"total":false,"last":false,"bands":true,"bandcols":false,"sep":false,"font":"","size":0,"pad":""},"callout":{"look":"trait","color":""},"quote":{"look":"guillemets","color":""},"toc":{"title":"Au sommaire","showTitle":true,"titleStyle":"majuscules","titleAlign":"gauche","docTitle":true,"levels":5,"font":"","size":0,"color":"#2e6da4","frame":"fond","number":"I","leaders":true,"indent":true,"preset":"encadre"},"diagram":{"fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#2e86c1","textColor":"#1b4f72","link":"#2e86c1","font":"Segoe UI","strokeWidth":2,"shadow":false,"palette":false},"code":{"palette":"clair","frame":"cadre","font":"","size":0,"num":false,"line":""},"margins":null},"mode":"note","pages":{"size":"A4","w":210,"h":297,"orient":"portrait","turned":{},"margins":{"top":25,"bottom":25,"left":25,"right":25},"numbers":{"on":true,"pos":"bas-centre","format":"1","from":1,"first":1,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"box":"aucun","skip":{}},"header":{"on":true,"html":""},"footer":{"on":true,"html":""},"firstDifferent":false,"keep":true,"chapters":0,"tagsAfterCover":true,"custom":false}},"content":{"html":"<h1 class=\"ft-title\">Exporter et partager</h1><p><b>Fichier &gt; Exporter</b> (<b>Ctrl+Maj+E</b>) enregistre le document dans un autre format. L’export reproduit l’affichage : polices, thème, tableaux, images, schémas, notes et numéros de page.</p><p class=\"ft-legend\" data-kind=\"tableau\" data-cap=\"Tableau 1\">Formats d’export</p><table class=\"ft-table\" data-demo-look=\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;liste&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;theme&quot;,&quot;header&quot;:true,&quot;first&quot;:true,&quot;sep&quot;:true,&quot;bands&quot;:true}\" data-style=\"grille\" data-color=\"theme\" data-header=\"oui\" data-bands=\"oui\" data-t=\"2\"><tbody><tr><td>Format</td><td>Usage</td></tr><tr><td>Word (.docx)</td><td>Continuer le travail dans Word ou LibreOffice.</td></tr><tr><td>PDF</td><td>Lire, imprimer ou envoyer le document tel quel ; les titres deviennent des signets.</td></tr><tr><td>Livre (PDF)</td><td>Format de livre (A5, 15 × 23&nbsp;cm…), avec marges de reliure, prêt pour l’imprimeur ou en livret à plier.</td></tr><tr><td>EPUB</td><td>Livre numérique pour liseuses et tablettes.</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote class=\"ft-callout\" data-look=\"trait\"><p><b>Typographie soignée.</b> L’option de la fenêtre d’export coupe les mots en fin de ligne et équilibre la justification du PDF.</p></blockquote><h2>Importer</h2><p>Un document Word (.docx) s’importe par Fichier &gt; Importer un document Word, ou par glisser-déposer sur la fenêtre : titres, listes, tableaux, images et notes sont repris.</p><h2>Partager un document Tomatoes Text</h2><p>Un fichier .tmtx contient tout le document (texte, images, réglages). Il peut être envoyé tel quel : un double-clic dans l’Explorateur l’ouvre dans Tomatoes Text. Fichier &gt; Ouvrir le dossier du projet montre l’emplacement des fichiers.</p><h2>À essayer</h2><ul class=\"ft-check\"><li>Exporter ce document en PDF, puis l’ouvrir.</li><li>Exporter le document Mise en page en Word : la page de titre et le plan sont conservés.</li></ul><p><b>Suite :</b> <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"d61de36e-2938-4236-ab5f-ac55584c36ef\">Personnaliser le logiciel</a>.</p>"},"tags":[{"name":"Tutoriel","color":"rouge"},{"name":"Finaliser","color":"violet"}],"links":[],"meta":{}}